    "What Gets Created\n",
    "After fitting, these important attributes become available:\n",
    "\n",
    "`word_index:` Dictionary mapping words to their numeric index\n",
    "\n",
    "Example: {'the': 1, 'cat': 2, 'sat': 3, ...}\n",
    "\n",
    "`word_counts:` Dictionary of word frequencies across all text\n",
    "\n",
    "Example: {'the': 15, 'cat': 3, 'sat': 2, ...}\n",
    "\n",
    "`word_docs:` Dictionary of document frequencies (how many texts contained each word)\n",
    "\n",
    "Example: {'the': 5, 'cat': 2, ...} (appeared in 5 texts and 2 texts respectively)\n",
    "\n",
    "`document_count`: Total number of documents processed\n"
   ]
